+Media used on The Daily Grind homepage:
+
+- `hero.mp4` and `hero-poster.jpg`: [Video sequence of the coffee preparation process](https://mixkit.co/free-stock-video/video-sequence-of-the-coffee-preparation-process-4989/), Mixkit. [Mixkit Stock Video Free License](https://mixkit.co/license/#videoFree). Video recompressed; poster extracted from footage.
+- `roasting-silent.mp4` and `roasting-poster.jpg`: [Close up of Coffee Beans in Coffee Roaster](https://www.pexels.com/video/close-up-of-coffee-beans-in-coffee-roaster-13882353/), Артем Ковальчук / Pexels. [Pexels License](https://www.pexels.com/license/). Video resized and recompressed, audio removed, poster extracted from footage.
+- `home-coffee-roasting.mp3`: [Home Coffee Roasting, part 1 (HPR3563)](https://hackerpublicradio.org/eps/hpr3563/index.html), dnt / Hacker Public Radio, March 30, 2022. [CC BY-SA 4.0](https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/). Unmodified episode.
+
+All media is served locally. Only the hero poster is preloaded by the document.
